{"path":"locale/locale/operator()","title":"std::locale::operator()","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::locale::</span>operator()","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/locale/operator()","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Compares two string arguments s1 and s2 according to the lexicographic comparison rules defined by this locale's std::collate<CharT> facet.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s1,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s2 <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two string arguments <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s1</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s2</span></code> according to the lexicographic comparison rules defined by this locale's <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"><span class=\"kw1960\">std::<span class=\"me2\">collate</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> facet. This operator allows any locale object that has a collate facet to be used as a binary predicate in the standard algorithms (such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/sort\">std::sort</a></span>) and ordered containers (such as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/set\">std::set</a></span>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> s1\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the first string to compare\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> s2\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the second string to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s1</span></code> is lexicographically less than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">s2</span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s1,\n                <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1236\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_string</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits,Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s2<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"><span class=\"kw1960\">std::<span class=\"me2\">collate</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">compare</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n               s1.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, s1.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> s1.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n               s2.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, s2.<span class=\"me1\">data</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> s2.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>A <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\">vector</a></span> of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">string</a></span>s can be sorted according to a non-default locale by using the locale object as comparator:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1240\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wstring</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>L<span class=\"st0\">\"жил\"</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">\"был\"</span>, L<span class=\"st0\">\"пёс\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/sort\"><span class=\"kw1630\">std::<span class=\"me2\">sort</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, v.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"ru_RU.UTF8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"был\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"жил\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>v<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"пёс\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/collate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>collate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines lexicographical comparison and hashing of strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/locale","title":"std::locale"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::locale::operator()","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Compares two string arguments s1 and s2 according to the lexicographic comparison rules defined by this locale's…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"s1, s2"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if s1 is lexicographically less than s2, false otherwise."},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example","note":"A vector of strings can be sorted according to a non-default locale by using the locale object as comparator:"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"collate","note":"defines lexicographical comparison and hashing of strings"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":188,"codeBlockCount":2}
